Scott is the closest to the truth.  There are two ways of losing
telepathy.  The first is by gremlin attack.  It is accompanied by the
message "The gremlin chuckles." and often a message detailing what
intrinsic has been lost.  (perhaps something like "You feel less
mentally acute.")  The second is by killing a peaceful human such as a
shopkeeper or vault guard, and is only applicable to Lawful
characters.  I'm not sure, but I think oracles and temple priests are
similarly protected.


